---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import PageIntro from '../components/PageIntro.astro';

const breadcrumbs = [
  { name: 'Home', url: '/' },
  { name: "Terms & Conditions", url: '/terms-and-conditions' }
];
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Terms & Conditions | SatvaStones Fine Anti-Tarnish Jewellery"
  description="Terms and Conditions of SatvaStones Jewellery. Binding legal agreement governed by the Indian Contract Act, 1872 and Information Technology Act, 2000."
  breadcrumbs={breadcrumbs}
>
  <PageIntro
    eyebrow="Indian Contract Act 1872 · IT Act 2000"
    title="Terms & conditions."
    lede="The agreement between you and SatvaStones Jewellery, a sole proprietorship of Anirudh A Verma, Chala, Vapi, Gujarat 396191."
    crumbs={breadcrumbs}
  >
    <p class="mt-6 text-[10px] uppercase tracking-[0.14em] text-[#8a8279]">Effective 1 March 2026 · Last updated November 2026</p>
  </PageIntro>

  <div class="bg-[#fbf9f5] pb-20 pt-4 sm:pt-8">
    <div class="policy-body mx-auto max-w-3xl space-y-8 px-5 sm:px-8">

      <!-- Section 1 -->
      <section class="space-y-3">
        <h2 class="text-base sm:text-lg font-bold text-[#14110f] border-b border-[#e5ded3] pb-2">
          1. Electronic Contract &amp; Acceptance
        </h2>
        <p>
          These Terms and Conditions constitute a valid, legally binding electronic contract generated by a computer system under the provisions of the <strong>Information Technology Act, 2000</strong>, the rules framed thereunder, and the amended provisions pertaining to electronic records in various statutes as amended by the Information Technology Act, 2000. This document does not require any physical or digital signatures.
        </p>
        <p>
          By accessing, browsing, adding items to cart, or transacting on <strong>www.satvastones.in</strong> (or <strong>satvastones.in</strong>), you ("Patron", "User", or "Buyer") acknowledge that you have read, understood, and unconditionally agree to be bound by these Terms, along with our <a href="/privacy-policy" class="text-[#8d3f3d] font-bold underline">Privacy Policy</a> and <a href="/refund-policy" class="text-[#8d3f3d] font-bold underline">Return &amp; Refund Policy</a>.
        </p>
      </section>

      <!-- Section 2 -->
      <section class="space-y-3">
        <h2 class="text-base sm:text-lg font-bold text-[#14110f] border-b border-[#e5ded3] pb-2">
          2. Patron Eligibility (Indian Contract Act, 1872)
        </h2>
        <p>
          In accordance with Section 11 of the <strong>Indian Contract Act, 1872</strong>, you represent and warrant that you are at least <strong>18 years of age</strong>, of sound mind, and not disqualified from contracting by any law to which you are subject. If you are under 18 years of age, you may browse our catalog only under the direct supervision and express consent of a parent or legal guardian.
        </p>
      </section>

      <!-- Section 3 -->
      <section class="space-y-3">
        <h2 class="text-base sm:text-lg font-bold text-[#14110f] border-b border-[#e5ded3] pb-2">
          3. Product Craftsmanship, Materials &amp; Fair Shine Disclosures
        </h2>
        <p>
          SatvaStones takes pride in complete scientific honesty regarding fashion jewellery:
        </p>
        <ul class="list-disc list-inside space-y-1.5 pl-2">
          <li><strong>Base Composition:</strong> All our pieces are crafted from hypoallergenic, medical-grade <strong>316L surgical stainless steel</strong> coated with <strong>18K gold using Physical Vapor Deposition (PVD) vacuum technology</strong>.</li>
          <li><strong>Waterproof Durability:</strong> Our jewellery does not oxidize, turn green, or peel under daily exposure to fresh water, sweat, gym workouts, or tropical humidity.</li>
          <li><strong>Honest Shine Policy:</strong> While vacuum PVD gold is extraordinarily resistant, we reject deceptive marketing claims of "infinite permanent shine." Constant abrasion against coarse abrasive surfaces or concentrated industrial bleach will gradually wear down any micro-coating. Proper care in accordance with our <a href="/jewellery-care" class="text-[#8d3f3d] font-bold underline">Jewellery Care Guide</a> preserves radiant luster for years.</li>
        </ul>
      </section>

      <!-- Section 4 -->
      <section class="space-y-3">
        <h2 class="text-base sm:text-lg font-bold text-[#14110f] border-b border-[#e5ded3] pb-2">
          4. Pricing, GST &amp; Razorpay Payment Terms
        </h2>
        <p>
          All product prices displayed on our website are denominated in <strong>Indian Rupees (INR / ₹)</strong> and are <strong>inclusive of applicable Goods and Services Tax (GST)</strong> under GSTIN: <strong>24DDAPV4074H1ZF</strong>.
        </p>
        <ul class="list-disc list-inside space-y-1.5 pl-2">
          <li><strong>Shipping Charges:</strong> Free Pan-India express delivery is provided on all orders totaling <strong>₹499 or more</strong>. A nominal shipping fee of ₹49 applies to orders under ₹499.</li>
          <li><strong>Payment Processing:</strong> Electronic payments are routed securely through <strong>Razorpay</strong> (UPI, Google Pay, PhonePe, Paytm, RuPay, Visa, Mastercard, and NetBanking). We do not record or retain card numbers or credentials.</li>
          <li><strong>Tax Invoices:</strong> A valid GST Tax Invoice with SAC/HSN codes is issued electronically with every completed order and can be downloaded on demand.</li>
        </ul>
      </section>

      <!-- Section 5 -->
      <section class="space-y-3">
        <h2 class="text-base sm:text-lg font-bold text-[#14110f] border-b border-[#e5ded3] pb-2">
          5. Order Dispatch &amp; Handover from Vapi Hub
        </h2>
        <p>
          Every order placed on SatvaStones is hand-inspected, wrapped in a protective velvet pouch, and dispatched directly from our <strong>Vapi store location (Gujarat - 396191)</strong> within <strong>24–48 hours</strong> of payment authorization. Deliveries are executed via reputed express logistics partners (BlueDart Air Express, Delhivery Prime, Xpressbees). Estimated transit time is <strong>2 to 5 business days</strong> depending on delivery pincode.
        </p>
      </section>

      <!-- Section 6 -->
      <section class="space-y-3">
        <h2 class="text-base sm:text-lg font-bold text-[#14110f] border-b border-[#e5ded3] pb-2">
          6. Intellectual Property Rights
        </h2>
        <p>
          All content displayed on this website, including but not limited to the brand name "SatvaStones", script logos, product photography, editorial text, jewelry stacking configurations, software code, and UI components, is the exclusive intellectual property of <strong>Anirudh A Verma</strong>. Any unauthorized copying, reproduction, hotlinking, or commercial exploitation is strictly prohibited and subject to legal prosecution under the Indian Copyright Act, 1957 and Trade Marks Act, 1999.
        </p>
      </section>

      <!-- Section 7 -->
      <section class="space-y-3">
        <h2 class="text-base sm:text-lg font-bold text-[#14110f] border-b border-[#e5ded3] pb-2">
          7. Limitation of Liability &amp; Force Majeure
        </h2>
        <p>
          To the maximum extent permitted by applicable Indian laws, SatvaStones and its proprietor shall not be liable for any indirect, punitive, or consequential damages arising out of delays caused by courier transit disruptions, natural calamities, strikes, state borders closures, or events beyond our reasonable control (Force Majeure). In any event, our total aggregate liability shall strictly not exceed the actual transaction value paid by the customer for the specific order.
        </p>
      </section>

      <!-- Section 8 -->
      <section class="space-y-3 bg-[#f4efe7] p-5 border border-[#e5ded3]">
        <h2 class="text-base font-bold text-[#14110f]">
          8. Governing Law, Dispute Resolution &amp; Jurisdiction
        </h2>
        <p>
          These Terms and any dispute or claim arising out of or in connection with them shall be governed by and construed in accordance with the <strong>laws of the Republic of India</strong>.
        </p>
        <p>
          In the event of any dispute, the parties shall first attempt to resolve it amicably through our Grievance Officer within 30 days. If unresolved, the dispute shall be referred to arbitration in accordance with the <strong>Arbitration and Conciliation Act, 1996</strong> by a sole arbitrator mutually appointed by the parties. The seat and venue of arbitration shall be <strong>Vapi / Valsad, Gujarat, India</strong>. Subject to the arbitration clause, the courts having jurisdiction over <strong>Vapi / Valsad District, Gujarat, India</strong> (and the Hon'ble High Court of Gujarat at Ahmedabad) shall have exclusive jurisdiction.
        </p>
      </section>

    </div>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>
